Hi Amy,

參考以下R程式與附圖, 目前mdy執行正常, 再測試看看.

# Windows 10, 64位元, 繁體中文版
library(lubridate)
stock <- read.table("0001.csv", header = TRUE, sep =",")
str(stock)

mdy("Aug 08,2019")
# [1] "2019-08-08"

mdy("Jul 31,2019")
# [1] "2019-07-31"

head(stock)
head(mdy(stock$Date))
# mdy 資料轉換正常

